// Title: Potentially Suspicious Rundll32 Activity
// Rule ID: e593cf51-88db-4ee1-b920-37e89012a3c9
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1218.011
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_rundll32_susp_activity.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
